# Fix 6 High-Priority Defects — Updated with Business Rules

## Business Rules (from Programs Tab)

| Booking Type | Category (from Programs) | Conflict Rule | Recurrence |
|---|---|---|---|
| **Spot Booking** | Hourly Slot | **Exclusive** — 1 player per court per slot. No other booking allowed at same time | Single Day |
| **Members** | Individual | **Max 6** members per court per 1-hour slot. No other booking type allowed at same time | Monthly (weekday/weekend) |
| **Group/Lease** | Group Members | **No restriction** on member count. No other booking type allowed at same time | Monthly |
| **Guest Play** | Peak hour / Non peak hour | Guest **joins an existing Member slot** — player wants to play along with a member. So a Member booking must exist first | Single Day |
| **Coaching** | Kids, Women, Adults (from coaching_schedule) | **Unlimited students** per court per slot | Monthly |
| **Advance Training** | 3 Session | **Exclusive** — court blocked for 3 sessions/3 hours a week for 6 days. No other booking allowed | Monthly (6 days) |
| **Personal Training** | Private Coaching | **Exclusive** — court blocked for 1 hour. No other booking allowed at same time | Single Day |

> [!IMPORTANT]
> All categories and their pricing are populated **dynamically from the Programs tab** (`tenantSettings`). The admin configures schedules and pricing on Programs → these automatically appear in the Reserve a Court dropdown hierarchy.

